From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mscoree: ICorDebug process enumerator, GetProcess, controller state and process memory (3732)

mscoree: ICorDebug process enumerator, GetProcess, controller state and process memory

The process enumerator is its own object with a position (Next, Skip, Reset,
Clone, GetCount). GetProcess finds the debuggee, Continue counts stops like the
controller documents, IsRunning, HasQueuedCallbacks, Detach (the process goes on),
ReadMemory, WriteMemory, GetThreadContext and SetThreadContext work on the
debuggee. SetUnmanagedHandler keeps the callback. CanCommitChanges and
CommitChanges stay E_NOTIMPL as documented (obsolete).
---
